# Used only when Cloudflare Pages serves the repository root as-is (git build with no build command / output dir).
# Script URLs are NOT versioned there, so nothing may be cached as immutable: everything is revalidated (ETag),
# a new push is picked up on the next load. build.sh writes its own _headers (versioned JS cached 1 year) into
# its output dir, so this file does not affect ./deploy.sh or a `bash build.sh` -> dist git build.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache, must-revalidate
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/AGENT-NOTES.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/supabase/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
/shots/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
